export anchor AuroraStyle:
    number: 269
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Aurora
    idea: Green and violet northern lights ribbon across a deep night sky header, and the files sit below in calm dark panels lit by one thin aurora edge.
    base: dark
    palette:
        sky: #080d1c, page and the foot of the header sky
        panel: #0f1730, file and details panels
        row: #131d3a, folder cards
        selected: #18244a, the selected file row
        ink: #eef2ff, text
        muted: #a9b4d0, meta, labels and inactive tabs
        line: #24305a, panel borders and dividers
        auroraGreen: #62e8a6, primary button, current tab edge, Starred, folder icons, selected edge and focus
        auroraViolet: #b9a2ff, file icons, Shared, the view switch edge and the ribbon blend
        greenInk: #04281a, text on green
    type:
        One stack, Avenir Next, Segoe UI Variable Display, Segoe UI,
        system-ui. Base 15px. The title is 46px at 600, the details title
        19px at 600, file names 15px at 500, meta 14px muted, chips 12.5px
        at 600 and labels 12px caps tracked 0.06em.
    layout:
        A full width sky header fades from near black to deep navy, with
        small stars and three blurred green and violet ribbon strokes kept
        to the right of the title. It holds the aurora B mark with
        Brightwork Drive, a dark pill Search files field and an MO disc,
        then the five places as pill tabs with My files ringed in green,
        then the breadcrumb and title on the left and a dark storage card
        with 64.2 GB of 100 GB used and a green to violet bar on the right.
        Below, a wide panel and a 340px details panel, each with a 2px
        gradient line on its top edge. The wide panel has Upload, New
        folder and a List or Grid switch, two folder cards side by side,
        then column heads and six file rows with status chips. The
        selected row is lighter with a green left edge. Details shows a
        preview, the name, a Starred chip, facts and the three buttons.
        Below 1100px details stack under files. Below 760px the tabs scroll
        sideways and the ribbons shrink to the top band.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px page gutters, 24px between panels, 16 to 18px panel padding.
    density: Medium. A tall sky header, two folder cards, then six file rows.
    corners: 16px panels, 12px cards and preview, 10px buttons and chips, pill tabs and search.
    borders: 1px #24305a panel borders with a 2px green to violet gradient line across each panel top.
    shadows: None on panels. The ribbons are blurred strokes at 45 to 62 percent opacity kept away from text.
    icons:
        18px line icons in violet, green for folders. Status chips pair a
        filled star with Starred in green, two heads with Shared with 4
        people in violet and an up arrow ring with Uploading 62% over a
        gradient bar.
    focus: A 2px green outline with a 3px offset and a soft green halo.
    tone: Calm and plain, such as Details and 64.2 GB of 100 GB used.
